Saved: analysis/noise_diagnostic.png

CONCLUSION
  If a large fraction of rays register under one photon, the log transform
  saturates and the interior carries no information. The network then returns
  the conditional mean (a smooth grey disc) — which is the correct MSE answer
  to an input with no signal, not a failure of the architecture.
